		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance:</strong> In addition to comprehensive insurance, packers and movers can also provide IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) marine transit insurance. This type of insurance covers goods for potential damages or losses due to unforeseen events such as accidents, floods, or earthquakes during transportation between Jamshedpur and Durg Bhilai.</span></li>
